---
import { contact, cv } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="sec on-dark" id="contacto" aria-labelledby="contacto-title">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div class="contact__lead">
      <h2 id="contacto-title" class="display contact__title mask reveal-h">
        <span class="line" style="--i:0"><span>Muchas</span></span>
        <span class="line" style="--i:1"><span>gracias</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="prose reveal" style="margin-top: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem)">
        ¿Tienes un proyecto en mente o quieres conversar sobre diseño? Escríbeme por el medio que prefieras.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="contact__list reveal">
      <li>
        <a href={contact.whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="k">WhatsApp</span>
          <span class="v">{contact.phoneDisplay}</span>
          <span class="go arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>
          <span class="k">Email</span>
          <span class="v">{contact.email}</span>
          <span class="go arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href={contact.instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="k">Instagram</span>
          <span class="v">{contact.instagramHandle}</span>
          <span class="go arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href={cv.href} download={cv.file}>
          <span class="k">Currículum</span>
          <span class="v">{cv.label} (PDF)</span>
          <span class="go arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
